- Stop mutating arrays in place. Replace pushes/splices with immutable updates to change references so OnPush inputs are marked dirty. Example: `this.items = [...this.items, newItem];` and when editing: `this.items = this.items.map(i => i.id === updated.id ? updated : i);`.
